<title>FINLAND: Clinton leaves Helsinki after summit.</title>
<headline>Clinton leaves Helsinki after summit.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton left Helsinki on Friday after his two-day summit with Russian President Boris Yeltsin.</p>
<p>Clinton, wheelchair-bound after an accident last week, flew out of Helsinki's Vantaa airport aboard his Air Force One jumbo jet after being lifted into the aircraft in an airport catering truck.</p>
